"entity": {
"name": "Grainger plc",
"description": "Grainger Plc engages in the investment, development, and management of properties. The firm owns and manages homes for rent across the United Kingdom. It operates through the following business segments: Private Rented Sector (PRS) and Reversionary. The PRS segment includes stabilised PRS assets. The Reversionary segment includes regulated tenancies, as well as CHARM portfolio. The company was founded in 1912 and is headquartered in Newcastle upon Tyne, the United Kingdom.",
